{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49577","headline":"临江仙 一 · 毛熙震","name":"临江仙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南齐天子宠婵娟，六宫罗绮三千，潘妃娇艳独芳妍。\n椒房兰洞，云雨降神仙。\n纵态迷欢心不足，风流可惜当年，纤腰婉约步金莲。\n妖君倾国，犹自至今传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}